{
  "id": "assistive-device",
  "term": "assistive device",
  "definition": "An assistive device is a wearable aid, such as an ankle-foot orthosis or exoskeleton, that helps support or improve a person’s movement. Its effects depend not only on the device itself but also on how forces and motion are transmitted through the body’s soft tissue where the device contacts the body.",
